# Routine "Weekly commitment check": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Thursday morning, what the team still owes organizers for events already said yes to, with anything overdue first.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/event-request-desk && pi -p "/weekly-event-commitment-check"
